title: dnf Update Check
agents: linux
author: comNET GmbH, based on work of Henri Wahl <henri@nagstamon.de>, based on work of Karsten Schoeke <karsten.schoeke@geobasis-bb.de>, Stefan Schlesinger <sts@ono.at>
catalog: generic
license: GPL
distribution: check_mk
description:
 This check checks for available updates via {dnf} on RedHat and 
 this derivates. You need to install the plugin {dnf}
 into the {plugins} directory of your agent.

 The check gets critical if kernel updates require a reboot.
 This state can be overriden via a WATO rule.
 It gets warning state if there are any updates available.

inventory:
 One service will be created for each system where the {dnf}
 plugin produces a non-empty output.

